---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="About Us" description="Family-run standards, field-tested quality. Buena Vista Turf Farm brings family accountability and proven grasses to every North Texas sod order.">
  <section class="ph"><div class="wrap">
    <span class="eyebrow">About Buena Vista</span>
    <h1>Family-run standards, field-tested quality.</h1>
    <p class="lede">For DFW homeowners, landscapers, and sports turf managers across Ravenna, Ivanhoe, Collinsville, Ferris, Dallas-Fort Worth, and surrounding counties, Buena Vista Turf brings family accountability, proven grasses, and dependable service to every order.</p>
  </div></section>
  <section><div class="wrap">
    <span class="eyebrow">Our business is family</span>
    <h2>A family-run team built around quality, service, and repeat customers.</h2>
    <p class="lede">Customers come to Buena Vista Turf because the standard is personal. Our team grows, harvests, and delivers turf with the discipline of a field operation and the accountability of a family business.</p>
    <div class="grid g3" style="margin-top:52px">
      <div class="card"><h3>25+ yrs</h3><p style="color:var(--muted);font-size:.76rem;letter-spacing:.13em;text-transform:uppercase">Average staff longevity</p></div>
      <div class="card"><h3>DFW+</h3><p style="color:var(--muted);font-size:.76rem;letter-spacing:.13em;text-transform:uppercase">Ravenna, Ivanhoe, Collinsville, Ferris, Dallas-Fort Worth, and surrounding counties</p></div>
      <div class="card"><h3>Family</h3><p style="color:var(--muted);font-size:.76rem;letter-spacing:.13em;text-transform:uppercase">Ownership and operating culture</p></div>
    </div>
  </div></section>
  <section class="section-alt"><div class="wrap">
    <span class="eyebrow">Why our message is different</span>
    <h2>We do not sell from a distance.</h2>
    <p>A lot of companies talk about quality after the sale. We believe quality has to be visible before the sale. That is why our field photos, our weekly updates, our management page, and our quote process are all designed to show the work behind the grass.</p>
    <p>Customers should not have to guess whether the sod is being grown with care, whether the team knows how to manage harvest timing, or whether someone will answer questions when the job becomes real.</p>
    <p>Buena Vista Turf is built for customers who want more than a price on a pallet. They want practical guidance. They want straight answers. They want a team that understands North Texas heat, sun, shade, soil, traffic, irrigation, delivery access, and the simple fact that every lawn has a different purpose.</p>
    <p>Some customers are trying to improve curb appeal before selling a home. Some are finishing a new build. Some are repairing a field that takes heavy use. Some need grass that can carry the look of a business entrance. Our job is to help the customer choose with confidence, not overwhelm them with vague claims.</p>
  </div></section>
</Base>
<style>.ph{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#24462c,#0f1f12);padding:clamp(60px,9vw,120px) 0}</style>
